== Trivia ==
* The [[wikipedia:Sacred Heart|Sacred Heart]] (also known as the '''Most Sacred Heart of Jesus''') is a devotion practiced in Catholicism, which represents "the heart of Jesus Christ God, pierced on the cross", and God's "boundless and passionate love for mankind".

